Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:04.85,sign_3594_23_Name__Kanda_Taic,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\pos(350,172)\q2}History: {\fs10\fscy120}Saitama Prefecture, Saitama Municipal Urami\h\h\h\h\h\NElementary School. Same city, Urami East Middle School. After\h\h\Ngraduation, he enrolled in the same city's Iwasa Commercial\h\h\h\h\h\h\NHigh School. Dropped out in second year. Hired by Misaki\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\NConstruction, INC. Worked as an on-site laborer for two years,\h\h\Nthen changed jobs. Moved to Morioka City, Iwate Prefecture.\h\h\h\h\h\h\NWorked for Sakino Civil Engineering, LTC for four years.\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\NTransferred to Soma Manufacturing Inc. and worked as on-site\Nlaborer. Currently still listed as an on-site supervisor at the\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\Nsame company. He was confirmed dead inside the entrance of\h\h\Nhis apartment in Morioka City on June 23rd of this year, just past \h\N8:00 PM. It's believed he was stabbed to death by a cursed spirit.\h\NRight before his death, a resident witnessed Kanada shouting on\Nthe phone after returning from his shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.85,sign_3594_23_Name__Kanda_Taic,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(350,32)}Name: Shimada Osamu\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
