Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.85,sign_3594_23_Name__Kanda_Taic,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\pos(350,172)\q2}History: {\fs10\fscy120}Saitama Prefecture, Saitama Municipal Urami\h\h\h\h\h\NElementary School. Same city, Urami East Middle School. After\h\h\Ngraduation, he enrolled in Shounan Private High School and\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\Ngraduated. He spent two years working several part-time jobs\h\h\h\Ndoing construction work, office work, and independent\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\Ncontracts. Afterward he enrolled in Tongmyong University, and\h\h\Nafter graduating he joined Rinne & Kidd Inc. He worked there as\Na programmer for four years before transferring to SRAD'D Inc.\h\h\NHe worked there as a system engineer until the present. He was\h\Nconfirmed dead in front of the entrance of his apartment in\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\NTsurumi Ward, Yokohama, on August 18th of this year, around \h\h\N3:00 PM. It is suspected that he was stabbed to death by a cursed \Nspirit when he returned home from a nearby convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:08.64,Main,Akari,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(320,342)}Shimada Osamu in Yokohama, in August.
